 "synopsis": "Gallantt Industry, a promoter of steel products manufacturer Gallantt Ispat, sold a 1.09% stake consisting of 26.51 lakh equity shares in the company to Suryalaxmi Infracon through an open-market transaction. The deal was executed at Rs 565 per share for a total consideration of Rs 149.83 crore. Following the transaction, shares of Gallantt Ispat closed down 0.99% at Rs 548.80 amid higher trading volumes. The transaction took place on October 22, according to bulk deal data released on Thursday.",
